1
00:00:02,522 --> 00:00:03,563
Water...

2
00:00:04,816 --> 00:00:06,108
Earth...

3
00:00:06,859 --> 00:00:08,193
Fire...

4
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:10,320
Air.

5
00:00:11,364 --> 00:00:15,284
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,368 --> 00:00:19,037
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,664 --> 00:00:22,624
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,709 --> 00:00:23,959
could stop them.

9
00:00:24,043 --> 00:00:25,585
But when the world needed him most,

10
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:26,795
he vanished.

11
00:00:27,463 --> 00:00:28,672
100 years passed,

12
00:00:28,756 --> 00:00:31,008
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar,

13
00:00:31,092 --> 00:00:32,884
an airbender named Aang.

14
00:00:32,969 --> 00:00:35,095
And although
his airbending skills are great,

15
00:00:35,179 --> 00:00:38,473
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

16
00:00:38,975 --> 00:00:41,935
But I believe Aang can save the world.

17
00:01:16,763 --> 00:01:18,722
Absolutely not.

18
00:01:18,806 --> 00:01:21,183
The Yuyan archers stay here.

19
00:01:21,267 --> 00:01:24,102
Your request is denied,
Commander Zhao.

20
00:01:24,395 --> 00:01:27,814
Colonel Shinu, please reconsider.

21
00:01:28,149 --> 00:01:30,025
Their precision is legendary.

22
00:01:30,109 --> 00:01:33,070
The Yuyan can pin a fly
to a tree from 100 yards away

23
00:01:33,154 --> 00:01:34,696
without killing it.

24
00:01:37,116 --> 00:01:40,702
You're wasting their talents
using them as mere security guards.

25
00:01:40,787 --> 00:01:43,330
I can do whatever I want
with their talents.

26
00:01:43,414 --> 00:01:46,291
They're my archers,
and what I say goes.

27
00:01:46,542 --> 00:01:48,377
But my search for the Avatar is--

28
00:01:48,461 --> 00:01:50,879
Is nothing but a vanity project.

29
00:01:51,047 --> 00:01:52,881
We're fighting a real war here,

30
00:01:52,965 --> 00:01:55,467
and I need every man
I've got, commander.

31
00:01:55,551 --> 00:01:56,593
But--

32
00:01:56,677 --> 00:01:57,677
That's final!

33
00:01:57,762 --> 00:01:59,638
I don't want to hear
another word about it.

34
00:02:11,442 --> 00:02:13,485
News from Fire Lord Ozai?

35
00:02:14,695 --> 00:02:16,822
It appears I've been
promoted to admiral.

36
00:02:17,407 --> 00:02:20,617
My request is now an order.

37
00:02:42,223 --> 00:02:43,723
This should bring your fever down.

38
00:02:45,059 --> 00:02:47,602
You know what I love
about Appa the most?

39
00:02:47,937 --> 00:02:49,312
His sense of humor.

40
00:02:49,605 --> 00:02:50,689
That's nice.

41
00:02:50,773 --> 00:02:51,773
I'll tell him.

42
00:02:53,651 --> 00:02:54,651
Ha ha ha!

43
00:02:54,735 --> 00:02:56,027
Classic Appa.

44
00:02:56,112 --> 00:02:57,195
How's Sokka doing?

45
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,488
Not so good.

46
00:02:58,573 --> 00:02:59,781
Being out in that storm

47
00:02:59,866 --> 00:03:00,907
really did a number on him.

48
00:03:04,495 --> 00:03:06,705
I couldn't find
any ginger root for the tea,

49
00:03:06,789 --> 00:03:08,248
but I found a map.

50
00:03:08,332 --> 00:03:09,583
There's a herbalist institute

51
00:03:09,667 --> 00:03:11,084
on the top of that mountain.

52
00:03:11,169 --> 00:03:12,961
We could probably
find a cure for Sokka there.

53
00:03:13,379 --> 00:03:15,630
Aang, he's in no condition to travel.

54
00:03:15,715 --> 00:03:17,340
Sokka just needs more rest.

55
00:03:17,592 --> 00:03:19,426
I'm sure he'll be better by tomorrow.

56
00:03:23,723 --> 00:03:24,890
Not you, too.

57
00:03:25,224 --> 00:03:27,184
Relax. It was just a little cough.

58
00:03:27,268 --> 00:03:28,268
I'm fin--

59
00:03:34,859 --> 00:03:36,568
That's how Sokka started yesterday.

60
00:03:36,652 --> 00:03:37,819
Now look at him.

61
00:03:37,904 --> 00:03:39,362
He thinks he's an earthbender.

62
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:41,948
Take that, you rock.

63
00:03:43,075 --> 00:03:45,535
A few more hours
and you'll be talking nonsense, too.

64
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:46,995
I'm going to find some medicine.

65
00:03:53,544 --> 00:03:56,379
Maybe it's safer if I go on foot.

66
00:03:56,464 --> 00:03:57,797
Keep an eye on them, guys.

67
00:04:00,426 --> 00:04:01,635
Ha ha!

68
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:03,178
You guys are killing me.

69
00:04:15,942 --> 00:04:18,860
We haven't been able to pick up
the Avatar's trail since the storm,

70
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:21,905
but if we continue
heading northeast...

71
00:04:23,574 --> 00:04:24,741
What do they want?

72
00:04:24,825 --> 00:04:27,911
Perhaps a sporting game of Pai Sho.

73
00:04:33,292 --> 00:04:34,501
The hunt for the Avatar

74
00:04:34,585 --> 00:04:35,961
has been given prime importance.

75
00:04:36,379 --> 00:04:37,921
All information regarding the Avatar

76
00:04:38,005 --> 00:04:40,257
must be reported
directly to Admiral Zhao.

77
00:04:40,758 --> 00:04:42,592
Zhao has been promoted?

78
00:04:42,677 --> 00:04:44,886
Well, good for him.

79
00:04:45,763 --> 00:04:47,973
I've got nothing to report to Zhao.

80
00:04:48,057 --> 00:04:50,517
Now get off my ship and let us pass.

81
00:04:51,102 --> 00:04:52,769
Admiral Zhao is not allowing ships

82
00:04:52,853 --> 00:04:54,396
in or out of this area.

83
00:04:55,106 --> 00:04:56,690
Off my ship!

84
00:04:57,441 --> 00:04:58,942
Excellent.

85
00:04:59,944 --> 00:05:01,528
I take the pot.

86
00:05:02,321 --> 00:05:04,072
But you're all improving.

87
00:05:04,156 --> 00:05:07,075
I'm certain you will win
if we play again.

88
00:05:13,165 --> 00:05:15,667
It says here
that the Avatar can create tornadoes

89
00:05:15,751 --> 00:05:17,168
and run faster than the wind.

90
00:05:17,253 --> 00:05:18,670
Pretty amazing.

91
00:05:18,754 --> 00:05:21,881
Aw, that's just a bunch
of Fire Lord propaganda.

92
00:05:21,966 --> 00:05:23,633
There's no way that's true.

93
00:05:38,858 --> 00:05:42,277
Katara, please, water.

94
00:05:42,361 --> 00:05:44,654
Listen carefully, Momo.

95
00:05:44,739 --> 00:05:48,908
I need you to take this
to the river and fill it with water.

96
00:05:54,165 --> 00:05:55,165
Got it?

97
00:06:14,602 --> 00:06:16,478
Hello. I'm sorry
to barge in like this,

98
00:06:16,562 --> 00:06:18,521
but I need some medicine
for my friends.

99
00:06:18,606 --> 00:06:20,106
They have fevers
and they've been coughing--

100
00:06:20,191 --> 00:06:22,108
Settle down, young man.

101
00:06:22,193 --> 00:06:25,111
Your friends are going to be fine.

102
00:06:25,404 --> 00:06:29,157
I've been up here
for over 40 years, you know.

103
00:06:29,241 --> 00:06:32,702
Used to be others,
but they all left years ago.

104
00:06:33,037 --> 00:06:35,872
Now it's just me and Miyuki.

105
00:06:36,666 --> 00:06:37,791
That's nice.

106
00:06:37,875 --> 00:06:42,128
Wounded Earth Kingdom troops
still come by now and again.

107
00:06:42,213 --> 00:06:43,838
Brave boys,

108
00:06:43,923 --> 00:06:45,882
and thanks to my remedies,

109
00:06:45,966 --> 00:06:49,469
they always leave in better shape
than when they arrived.

110
00:06:49,804 --> 00:06:51,429
That's nice. Are you almost done?

111
00:06:51,806 --> 00:06:52,889
Hold on.

112
00:06:52,973 --> 00:06:55,892
I just need to add
one last ingredient.

113
00:06:56,602 --> 00:06:58,645
Sandalwood?

114
00:06:58,729 --> 00:07:00,939
Yes-- No, that won't do.

115
00:07:01,023 --> 00:07:03,108
Banana leaf? Nope.

116
00:07:03,526 --> 00:07:04,859
Ginger root?

117
00:07:06,112 --> 00:07:08,279
Where is that pesky little plant?

118
00:07:15,413 --> 00:07:16,871
Is everything ok?

119
00:07:17,373 --> 00:07:19,082
It's been almost an hour

120
00:07:19,166 --> 00:07:21,751
and you haven't given
the men an order.

121
00:07:22,086 --> 00:07:23,336
I don't care what they do.

122
00:07:23,754 --> 00:07:25,547
Don't give up hope yet.

123
00:07:25,631 --> 00:07:28,133
You can still find the Avatar
before Zhao.

124
00:07:28,634 --> 00:07:29,759
How, uncle?

125
00:07:29,844 --> 00:07:30,844
With Zhao's resources,

126
00:07:30,928 --> 00:07:32,178
it's just a matter of time

127
00:07:32,263 --> 00:07:33,680
before he captures the Avatar.

128
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:37,225
My honor, my throne, my country--

129
00:07:37,309 --> 00:07:38,852
I'm about to lose them all.

130
00:07:41,814 --> 00:07:44,649
Here's what I was looking for.

131
00:07:45,192 --> 00:07:46,943
Plum blossom.

132
00:07:47,862 --> 00:07:50,238
Finally. Thanks for all your help.

133
00:07:50,322 --> 00:07:51,322
Hands off.

134
00:07:51,407 --> 00:07:53,241
What do you think you're doing?

135
00:07:53,325 --> 00:07:54,617
Taking the cure to my friends.

136
00:07:55,119 --> 00:07:57,454
Ha ha! This isn't a cure.

137
00:07:57,538 --> 00:07:59,289
It's Miyuki's dinner.

138
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:02,000
Plum blossom is her favorite.

139
00:08:02,084 --> 00:08:03,626
What about my friends?

140
00:08:03,711 --> 00:08:07,338
Well, all they need
is some frozen wood frogs.

141
00:08:07,423 --> 00:08:09,758
There's plenty of them
down in the valley swamp.

142
00:08:10,050 --> 00:08:12,260
What am I supposed to do
with frozen frogs?

143
00:08:12,344 --> 00:08:14,387
Why, suck on them, of course.

144
00:08:15,014 --> 00:08:16,097
Suck on them?

145
00:08:16,182 --> 00:08:18,600
The frog skin excretes a substance

146
00:08:18,684 --> 00:08:20,310
that'll cure your friends,

147
00:08:20,394 --> 00:08:22,437
but make sure you get plenty.

148
00:08:22,855 --> 00:08:24,731
Once those little critters thaw out,

149
00:08:24,815 --> 00:08:25,899
they're useless.

150
00:08:27,735 --> 00:08:29,110
You're insane, aren't you?

151
00:08:29,195 --> 00:08:30,653
That's right.

152
00:08:32,239 --> 00:08:34,407
Well, don't stand there all day.

153
00:08:34,492 --> 00:08:36,034
Go!

154
00:08:39,497 --> 00:08:40,497
Whoa!

155
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:55,261
I think you dropped this.

156
00:09:07,233 --> 00:09:08,650
Aah!

157
00:09:49,233 --> 00:09:50,275
A frog!

158
00:10:30,357 --> 00:10:32,692
So this is the great Avatar,

159
00:10:32,776 --> 00:10:35,528
master of all the elements.

160
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:37,947
I don't know how
you've managed to elude

161
00:10:38,032 --> 00:10:40,199
the Fire Nation for 100 years,

162
00:10:40,492 --> 00:10:44,287
but your little game
of hide and seek is over.

163
00:10:44,538 --> 00:10:45,997
I've never hidden from you.

164
00:10:46,081 --> 00:10:47,916
Untie me and I'll fight you right now.

165
00:10:48,292 --> 00:10:50,084
No.

166
00:10:50,669 --> 00:10:54,797
Tell me, how does it feel
to be the only airbender left?

167
00:10:55,424 --> 00:10:57,508
Do you miss your people?

168
00:10:58,594 --> 00:11:00,428
Don't worry.

169
00:11:00,512 --> 00:11:02,347
You won't be killed like they were.

170
00:11:02,973 --> 00:11:05,016
See, if you die, you'll just be reborn

171
00:11:05,100 --> 00:11:06,392
and the Fire Nation will have to begin

172
00:11:06,477 --> 00:11:09,062
its search for the Avatar
all over again.

173
00:11:09,521 --> 00:11:13,816
So I'll keep you alive,
but just barely.

174
00:11:20,032 --> 00:11:21,699
Blow all the wind you want.

175
00:11:21,784 --> 00:11:23,952
Your situation is futile.

176
00:11:24,036 --> 00:11:25,912
There is no escaping this fortress

177
00:11:26,413 --> 00:11:29,749
and no one is coming to rescue you.

178
00:11:36,590 --> 00:11:37,882
Water.

179
00:11:37,967 --> 00:11:40,343
Momo should be back any minute.

180
00:11:46,350 --> 00:11:47,684
No, Momo.

181
00:11:47,768 --> 00:11:48,977
Water.

182
00:11:49,478 --> 00:11:50,895
Wa-ter.

183
00:11:54,024 --> 00:11:57,443
Aang, what in the world
is taking you so long?

184
00:12:31,186 --> 00:12:45,491
All clear.

185
00:12:45,576 --> 00:12:46,576
Go on in.

186
00:13:07,473 --> 00:13:12,769
We are the sons and daughters
of fire, the superior element,

187
00:13:12,853 --> 00:13:17,023
until today, only one thing
stood in our path to victory--

188
00:13:17,107 --> 00:13:18,399
The Avatar!

189
00:13:18,692 --> 00:13:23,237
I am here to tell you
that he is now my prisoner!

190
00:13:26,241 --> 00:13:30,953
This is the year Sozin's Comet
returns to grant us its power!

191
00:13:33,165 --> 00:13:35,500
This is the year the Fire Nation

192
00:13:35,584 --> 00:13:38,211
breaks through
the walls of Ba Sing Se,

193
00:13:38,295 --> 00:13:40,880
and burns the city to the ground.

194
00:13:59,608 --> 00:14:01,025
What? No!

195
00:14:01,110 --> 00:14:03,903
Don't leave, frogs. My friends
are sick and they need you.

196
00:14:04,238 --> 00:14:06,072
Please go back to being frozen.

197
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:10,761
Aah!

198
00:15:21,023 --> 00:15:23,357
Who are you? What's going on?

199
00:15:23,775 --> 00:15:25,067
Are you here to rescue me?

200
00:15:27,779 --> 00:15:29,280
I'll take that as a yes.

201
00:15:35,537 --> 00:15:36,537
My frogs!

202
00:15:36,622 --> 00:15:37,622
Come back!

203
00:15:37,706 --> 00:15:39,332
And stop thawing out!

204
00:15:40,375 --> 00:15:41,500
Wait!

205
00:15:41,585 --> 00:15:44,086
My friends need to
suck on those frogs!

206
00:15:50,636 --> 00:15:53,512
How many times
do I have to tell you, Momo?

207
00:15:53,597 --> 00:15:54,972
We need water.

208
00:15:55,349 --> 00:15:57,308
Wa-ter.

209
00:15:58,477 --> 00:15:59,769
Forget it.

210
00:16:00,437 --> 00:16:02,480
Aang, please hurry.

211
00:16:02,898 --> 00:16:05,733
Who is this Aang kid
you keep talking about, your highness?

212
00:16:33,011 --> 00:16:35,388
I want a full transcription
of my speech

213
00:16:35,472 --> 00:16:36,806
sent to the Fire Lord,

214
00:16:37,140 --> 00:16:39,267
Along with glowing testimonials

215
00:16:39,351 --> 00:16:41,936
from all of the ranking officers
present, and--

216
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:56,701
Sir, shall I hold off
sending that speech to the Fire Lord?

217
00:17:05,210 --> 00:17:07,044
There. On the wall!

218
00:17:08,213 --> 00:17:09,338
Aah!

219
00:17:14,511 --> 00:17:16,554
The Avatar has escaped!

220
00:17:16,722 --> 00:17:18,764
Close all the gates immediately.

221
00:17:19,683 --> 00:17:21,225
Stay close to me.

222
00:18:07,522 --> 00:18:21,786
Aah!

223
00:18:45,018 --> 00:18:46,602
Take this.

224
00:18:47,062 --> 00:18:48,604
Jump on my back!

225
00:18:55,487 --> 00:18:56,654
Give me the next one!

226
00:19:14,131 --> 00:19:15,881
Hold your fire!

227
00:19:16,425 --> 00:19:18,467
The Avatar must be captured alive.

228
00:19:25,350 --> 00:19:26,434
Open the gate.

229
00:19:26,893 --> 00:19:28,436
Admiral, what are you doing?

230
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:29,562
Let them out.

231
00:19:29,646 --> 00:19:30,646
Now!

232
00:19:33,942 --> 00:19:35,526
How could you let them go?

233
00:19:35,610 --> 00:19:40,197
A situation like this requires...
Precision.

234
00:19:54,963 --> 00:19:56,297
Do you have a clear shot?

235
00:19:58,508 --> 00:19:59,884
Knock out the thief.

236
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:04,096
I'll deliver him to the Fire Lord
along with the Avatar.

237
00:20:19,112 --> 00:20:20,529
Quick! Recover the Avatar!

238
00:21:05,116 --> 00:21:06,325
You know what the worst part

239
00:21:06,409 --> 00:21:08,827
about being born
over 100 years ago is?

240
00:21:09,371 --> 00:21:11,372
I miss all the friends
I used to hang out with.

241
00:21:11,790 --> 00:21:13,374
Before the war started,

242
00:21:13,458 --> 00:21:15,668
I used to always
visit my friend, Kuzon.

243
00:21:15,752 --> 00:21:17,670
The two of us, we'd get in and out

244
00:21:17,754 --> 00:21:20,130
of so much trouble together.

245
00:21:20,215 --> 00:21:22,758
He was one of the best friends
I ever had...

246
00:21:22,842 --> 00:21:25,886
And he was from the Fire Nation,
just like you.

247
00:21:26,513 --> 00:21:28,097
If we knew each other back then,

248
00:21:28,181 --> 00:21:30,057
do you think
we could have been friends, too?

249
00:21:52,080 --> 00:21:53,956
Where have you been, Prince Zuko?

250
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,624
You missed music night.

251
00:21:55,959 --> 00:21:59,670
Lieutenant Jee sang
a stirring love song.

252
00:22:00,005 --> 00:22:01,755
I'm going to bed.

253
00:22:01,840 --> 00:22:02,965
No disturbances.

254
00:22:15,061 --> 00:22:16,186
Suck on these.

255
00:22:16,271 --> 00:22:17,605
It'll make you feel better.

256
00:22:20,233 --> 00:22:22,860
Aang, how was your trip?

257
00:22:22,944 --> 00:22:24,862
Did you make any new friends?

258
00:22:25,155 --> 00:22:26,155
No.

259
00:22:26,239 --> 00:22:27,281
I don't think I did.

260
00:22:45,258 --> 00:22:46,967
This is tasty.

261
00:22:50,221 --> 00:22:51,221
Ptooey!

262
00:22:51,306 --> 00:22:52,348
Aah!
